    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [X] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [X] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.comment\n\n### Description\n\nCurrently, the cursor is moved to the beginning of the line while toggling the comment. Would it be possible to make the cursor stick to the character below it before commenting?\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://user-images.githubusercontent.com/31820255/212968048-c5aa31cd-b4a8-403a-82a8-3532c4320d95.mp4\r\n\r\n",
